-## 9. Bounded statement, preserved failures and evidence plan
+## 9. Bounded statement, preserved failures and actual evidence
 
 Conditional theorem: under(1),(2), connected finite declared NN auxiliary graphs with the appended fresh rays, the explicit signed/padded controls(6),(8), isolation and full-space coefficient access, the finite smooth schedule prepares the complete auxiliary vacuum with the full retained-output comparison(12)-(13). It returns to exactly the same installed generator after both finite ramps, preserves the arbitrary displaced input records in E, and retains actual original-H aging. If the installed generator is positive, every nominal driven generator is positive. The three explicit single-port graphs admit the ray specialization in section5, conditional on their literal finite inventory rather than an arbitrary occupied substrate.
 
 The direct matching fails at(14), while routing succeeds conditionally without moving any original site. A forward-only path word does not in general restore intermediates; full endpoint words are essential. Excitation exchange is not full SWAP. Dirty/correlated E is outside the exact ready domain, and resetting A cannot simultaneously return E as the same independent pure resource on arbitrary input. Ignoring the turn-on full-space bound, omitting finite release, deleting compensation scalar offsets, commuting H through F, ignoring dense omitted edges or replacing actual clock aging by an unaged packet would change or invalidate this argument. These are scoped failed shortcuts, not a general no-go.
 
-At most one predeclared selected permutation/geometry fixture will be used. It will track integer register labels, not form a huge Hilbert matrix or approximate continuous dynamics. The general operator identity, smooth control, arbitrary-reference error, moments and work statements are analytic arguments and remain subject to independent review. Exact execution/source receipts and every actual failure will be preserved. The earlier single-port candidate's scientific program will not be rerun, and no prior packet, canonical source, Git state, audit, axiom, prompt or operational checkpoint will be changed.
+One predeclared exact permutation/geometry fixture executed once on2026-10-15 at12:49:15 UTC. Its selected L_b=8,Q_mem=3,n_old=2,M=4 instance has74 original factors,121 arbitrary-input auxiliary factors and121 newly supplied memory factors. It executed9,087 adjacent full-SWAP permutations on distinct integer labels, split3,569/2,345/3,173 between the components, with root-distance sums860/560/662. Every nominal intermediate restores, all original sites remain fixed, and every original auxiliary record ends in its paired memory. All269 declared checks passed. The forward-only mutation changed19 final register labels, so that shortcut's failure was retained. The exact complete word and paths are in ROUTING_CERTIFICATE.json.
+
+The same predeclared execution enumerated all300 NN adjacencies touching A or E, with263 declared and37 omitted. The new memory rays contribute121 selected edges and the two specified omitted neighbors; used root degrees are4,4,3. Unlike the earlier packet's later adjacency analysis, this packet's complete adjacency enumeration was in SELECTED_PLAN.md before launch. PREEXEC_DERIVATION.md is a contemporaneous byte copy, and PREEXEC_FREEZE.json seals the actual code/inputs. LAUNCH_RECEIPT.json was written before the child started; EXECUTION_RECEIPT.json records the actual exit code and complete output hashes. STDOUT.log and STDERR.log preserve the streams. No previous scientific program, matrix inverse, huge Hilbert matrix or continuous propagator was run.
+
+The selected permutation fixture checks neither the smooth Hamiltonian evolution nor the general parameter family, full-output Duhamel estimate, compensation suppliers, moment identities or work bounds. Those remain analytic claims requiring independent review. POST_RUN_DERIVATION.diff records the final analytic clarifications and actual evidence against the pre-execution argument. No prior packet, canonical source, Git state, audit, axiom, prompt or operational checkpoint was changed. The result is a conditional preparation route consuming supplied pure memory, not native initialization or a complete autonomous preparation-program construction.
